1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,160
Placement season.

2
00:00:01,114 --> 00:00:02,702
Zero offers.

3
00:00:02,552 --> 00:00:03,855
So I let Claude apply.

4
00:00:04,162 --> 00:00:05,483
Here's every step.

5
00:00:05,333 --> 00:00:06,112
Step one.

6
00:00:05,962 --> 00:00:07,493
Add Playwright to Claude.

7
00:00:07,343 --> 00:00:09,026
Microsoft's free browser tool,

8
00:00:08,876 --> 00:00:11,102
39,000 stars, one command.

9
00:00:11,076 --> 00:00:12,179
Now Claude can open

10
00:00:12,029 --> 00:00:13,121
a careers page,

11
00:00:12,971 --> 00:00:14,474
read the form, and type.

12
00:00:14,324 --> 00:00:15,055
Step two.

13
00:00:14,905 --> 00:00:16,083
Give it your resume.

14
00:00:15,933 --> 00:00:17,026
This week alone,

15
00:00:16,876 --> 00:00:19,017
901 fresher jobs went up

16
00:00:18,867 --> 00:00:20,302
on company sites in India.

17
00:00:20,276 --> 00:00:21,598
Claude scores each one

18
00:00:21,448 --> 00:00:22,617
against your resume,

19
00:00:22,467 --> 00:00:24,150
and keeps the real matches.

20
00:00:24,029 --> 00:00:24,940
Step three.

21
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:25,912
It fills the form.

22
00:00:25,857 --> 00:00:27,521
Name, college, projects,

23
00:00:27,371 --> 00:00:28,912
even "why this company."

24
00:00:28,762 --> 00:00:29,931
Then it stops.

25
00:00:29,876 --> 00:00:31,674
Right before Submit.

26
00:00:31,524 --> 00:00:33,036
That's a rule I typed,

27
00:00:32,886 --> 00:00:33,817
not a setting.

28
00:00:33,714 --> 00:00:35,131
So I read every form.

29
00:00:35,029 --> 00:00:36,521
I press submit.

30
00:00:36,371 --> 00:00:37,655
Company sites only.

31
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:39,064
LinkedIn bans bots.

32
00:00:38,914 --> 00:00:40,255
Comment APPLY and I'll

33
00:00:40,105 --> 00:00:41,236
DM you the setup,

34
00:00:41,086 --> 00:00:42,445
plus the exact prompt.

